.TH "GCObject" "3type" "2026\-11\-05" "GCmalloc"
.SH NAME
\fBGCObject\fR \- GC type\&.
.SH DESCRIPTION
This is an header that \fBGCMalloc\fR(3) puts before pointer\&.
.PP
\fBGCObject\fR includes:
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBnext\fR: pointer to next node in all pointers
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBnext_root\fR: pointer to next node in roots
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBnext_grey\fR: pointer to next node in grey pointers
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBnext_dep\fR: pointer to next node dependency
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBdestructor\fR: destructor that registered by \fBGCRegDestructor\fR(3)
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBmagic\fR: magic char array for validation\&.
.br
\fB\-\-\fR \fBmetadata\fR: color of object\&.
.SH AUTHORS
Project and man\-page: TheCRatTime\&.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBRunGC\fR(3), \fBGCMalloc\fR(3), \fBGCmalloc\fR(3), \fBGCWriteBarrier\fR(3),
\fBGCRegDestructor\fR(3)
